  "spec_text": "Build a six-bit saturating event counter. Inputs are clk, rst_n, enable, event_in, and clear (all one bit). Outputs are count (six bits) and full (one bit). At each rising clock edge: rst_n=0 synchronously clears count to zero; otherwise clear=1 clears count and takes priority over enable/event_in; otherwise increment count only when enable and event_in are both 1. Once count is 63 it holds until clear or reset. full is combinationally 1 exactly when count is 63. Use a 50 MHz target. No prescaler or extra features.",
